ttf-radisnoir (0.9b-2) unstable; urgency=low

  * Team upload.
  * Drop defoma stuff, since it is unused and obsolete
    - Incidentally, this also closes: #551526
  * Drop the unused fontforge scripts
  * Switch to dh instead of long-style debhelper
  * Expand on the package description a bit
  * Use "Copyright" instead of "(C)" since the later isn't legally valid
  * Move to "new" fonts section
  * Also install the OpenType font file
  * Switch to dpkg-source v3.0 format
  * Add a watch file to check for new versions

